// Q-172 Of two elements side by side in a component or view, only the last reaches the page, and `quillo check` says ok: the first, with any handler on it, is gone without a word
// mode: check
// fixed-when: this element is not on the page
// From FEEDBACK21.md §Q-172 (found on c59890e). A body gives its last expression, so this
// follows from that rule; what is missing is a word from `quillo check`.

component Pair() {
    <p>one</p>
    <p>two</p>
}

route GET / = <html><body><Pair/></body></html>
